{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 01 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">CNN 主干：从大规模分类到现代卷积</span><span class=\"lang-en\">CNN Backbones</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_083_resnext-title\">ResNeXt</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">在 residual bottleneck 中以 cardinality 控制的 grouped 3×3 convolution 聚合多个等拓扑变换。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Aggregates multiple homogeneous residual branches via grouped 3×3 convolutions governed by a cardinality hyperparameter.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">图像或上一 stage 特征</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Input image or preceding stage feature map</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">分组聚合残差特征与分类/下游输出</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Grouped aggregated residual representations and downstream task predictions</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 3 · PDF p.4</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content_cvpr_2017/html/Xie_Aggregated_Residual_Transformations_CVPR_2017_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_083_resnext')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_083_resnext')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"ResNeXt original paper architecture figure, Figure 3\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/593079305d6062e5271a.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 3 · PDF p.4</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_083_resnext', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_083_resnext\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_083_resnext')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_083_resnext', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_083_resnext\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">输入 x</span><span class=\"lang-en\">input x</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">当前 stage feature map</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests input image or preceding stage feature map and prepares initial tensor representations (input x).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"当前 stage feature map\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests input image or preceding stage feature map and prepares initial tensor representations (input x).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"输入 x\" data-node-name-en=\"input x\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_083_resnext', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">输入 x</span><span class=\"lang-en\">input x</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">当前 stage feature map</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests input image or preceding stage feature map and prepares initial tensor representations (input x).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"把通道映射到分组变换的 bottleneck 宽度\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes 1×1 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"1×1 降维\" data-node-name-en=\"1×1\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_083_resnext', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">1×1 降维</span><span class=\"lang-en\">1×1</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">把通道映射到分组变换的 bottleneck 宽度</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes 1×1 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"cardinality C 个同拓扑分支，以 grouped convolution 高效实现\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Grouped 3×3 Conv within the core aggregated grouped residual cnn computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"分组 3×3\" data-node-name-en=\"Grouped 3×3 Conv\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_083_resnext', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">分组 3×3</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Grouped 3×3 Conv</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">cardinality C 个同拓扑分支，以 grouped convolution 高效实现</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Grouped 3×3 Conv within the core aggregated grouped residual cnn computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"融合分组输出并恢复 block 输出通道\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs 1×1 within the core aggregated grouped residual cnn computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"1×1 扩维\" data-node-name-en=\"1×1\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_083_resnext', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">1×1 扩维</span><span class=\"lang-en\">1×1</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">融合分组输出并恢复 block 输出通道</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs 1×1 within the core aggregated grouped residual cnn computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"尺寸相同时直连，stage 切换时用 projection shortcut\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Identity / projection within the core aggregated grouped residual cnn computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Identity / 投影\" data-node-name-en=\"Identity / projection\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_083_resnext', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Identity / 投影</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Identity / projection</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">尺寸相同时直连，stage 切换时用 projection shortcut</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Identity / projection within the core aggregated grouped residual cnn computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"y=shortcut(x)+Σ_i T_i(x)\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Residual Addition within the core aggregated grouped residual cnn computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"残差相加\" data-node-name-en=\"Residual Addition\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_083_resnext', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">残差相加</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Residual Addition</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">y=shortcut(x)+Σ_i T_i(x)</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Residual Addition within the core aggregated grouped residual cnn computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"在多个空间尺度重复 aggregated residual blocks\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies hierarchical to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"层级堆叠\" data-node-name-en=\"hierarchical\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_083_resnext', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">层级堆叠</span><span class=\"lang-en\">hierarchical</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">在多个空间尺度重复 aggregated residual blocks</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies hierarchical to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"全局分类或作为检测、分割 encoder 输出\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces grouped aggregated residual representations and downstream task predictions via GAP.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"GAP / 任务头\" data-node-name-en=\"GAP\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_083_resnext', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">GAP / 任务头</span><span class=\"lang-en\">GAP</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">全局分类或作为检测、分割 encoder 输出</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces grouped aggregated residual representations and downstream task predictions via GAP.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"ResNeXt Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · cardinality 控制的聚合残差变换</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Cardinality-Controlled Aggregated Residual Transformations</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"ResNeXt：核心公式 · cardinality 控制的聚合残差变换\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"83\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"28.738325pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.850917 -67.93141 227.882943 28.738325\" width=\"227.882943pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M2.85475 0V-.108683C2.282351-.115929 2.166422-.188385 2.166422-.536171V-4.883507L2.108458-4.897998L.804257-4.238652V-4.137214C.891204-4.173442 .970905-4.202424 .999887-4.216916C1.130307-4.267635 1.253482-4.296617 1.325937-4.296617C1.478094-4.296617 1.543304-4.187933 1.543304-3.956075V-.673837C1.543304-.434734 1.48534-.268086 1.369411-.202876C1.260727-.137666 1.15929-.115929 .854976-.108683V0H2.85475Z\" id=\"m083_g23-49\"></path><path d=\"M3.441641-.992642L3.347448-1.028869C3.079363-.615873 2.98517-.550663 2.65912-.550663H.927432L2.144686-1.825881C2.78954-2.499718 3.072117-3.050381 3.072