_g7-16\" y=\"-61.927805\"></use><use x=\"74.612877\" xlink:href=\"#m083_g19-44\" y=\"-50.9191\"></use><use x=\"83.798417\" xlink:href=\"#m083_g23-51\" y=\"-55.03366\"></use><use x=\"87.725691\" xlink:href=\"#m083_g10-2\" y=\"-55.03366\"></use><use x=\"92.642047\" xlink:href=\"#m083_g23-51\" y=\"-55.03366\"></use><use x=\"82.911758\" xlink:href=\"#m083_g16-56\" y=\"-47.791151\"></use><use x=\"85.679025\" xlink:href=\"#m083_g16-150\" y=\"-47.791151\"></use><use x=\"87.984476\" xlink:href=\"#m083_g23-50\" y=\"-47.791151\"></use><use x=\"98.990395\" xlink:href=\"#m083_g13-3\" y=\"-50.9191\"></use><use x=\"106.414719\" xlink:href=\"#m083_g19-100\" y=\"-50.9191\"></use><use x=\"112.332516\" xlink:href=\"#m083_g13-185\" y=\"-50.9191\"></use><use x=\"115.789548\" xlink:href=\"#m083_g19-44\" y=\"-50.9191\"></use><use x=\"124.975088\" xlink:href=\"#m083_g23-49\" y=\"-55.03366\"></use><use x=\"128.902362\" xlink:href=\"#m083_g10-2\" y=\"-55.03366\"></use><use x=\"133.818718\" xlink:href=\"#m083_g23-49\" y=\"-55.03366\"></use><use x=\"124.088429\" xlink:href=\"#m083_g16-56\" y=\"-47.863876\"></use><use x=\"126.855696\" xlink:href=\"#m083_g16-150\" y=\"-47.863876\"></use><use x=\"129.161147\" xlink:href=\"#m083_g23-49\" y=\"-47.863876\"></use><use x=\"140.167065\" xlink:href=\"#m083_g13-3\" y=\"-50.9191\"></use><use x=\"147.073332\" xlink:href=\"#m083_g19-71\" y=\"-50.9191\"></use><use x=\"151.979914\" xlink:href=\"#m083_g13-186\" y=\"-50.9191\"></use><use x=\"155.994848\" xlink:href=\"#m083_g7-17\" y=\"-61.927805\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">仅靠加深或加宽网络的计算收益递减且设计空间复杂</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Scaling depth or width alone yielded diminishing returns and required intricate per-branch hyperparameter tuning.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">在残差块中并行聚合等拓扑分支，以 cardinality 控制表示容量</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Aggregate C parallel identical-topology transformations inside a residual bottleneck, introducing cardinality C as a third scaling axis.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">引入 grouped convolution 实现可扩展的 split-transform-merge</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Formulates split–transform–merge cleanly as grouped convolution with minimal engineering overhead.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">常用于 2D/3D 医学分类、检测和分割编码器</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Frequently adopted in 2D/3D medical classification, nodule detection, and volumetric encoder backbones.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">grouped convolution 已成现代 CNN 基础构件；原始主干不是当前唯一强基线</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Grouped/depthwise convolution is now a permanent staple of modern CNNs.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">除深度和宽度外，引入 cardinality 作为表示容量维度。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">等拓扑分支的 split-transform-merge 可由 grouped 3×3 convolution 紧凑实现。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">残差捷径保持优化稳定，分组卷积控制在相近计算量下增加变换多样性。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Aggregate C parallel identical-topology transformations inside a residual bottleneck, introducing cardinality C as a third scaling axis.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Formulates split–transform–merge cleanly as grouped convolution with minimal engineering overhead.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Cardinality-Controlled Aggregated Residual Transformations.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">可替换 2D/3D 医学分类、检测和分割编码器中的普通 ResNet bottleneck。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">分组数、每组宽度和 3D 内存需共同调节；架构优势不能替代强数据增强与外部验证。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Frequently adopted in 2D/3D medical classification, nodule detection, and volumetric encoder backbones.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Grouped/depthwise convolution is now a permanent staple of modern CNNs.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content_cvpr_2017/html/Xie_Aggregated_Residual_Transformations_CVPR_2017_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Aggregated Residual Transformations for Deep Neural Networks</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/facebookresearch/ResNeXt\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}